        "text": "<div><div class=\"eyebrow\">RecallWeave \u00b7 An offline algorithm lab</div><h1>Edit distance</h1><p class=\"intro\">Change a string. Inspect every prefix decision. Replay one cheapest transformation.</p><p class=\"hint\">Exact insertion, deletion and substitution costs. No transposition, text normalization or meaning comparison.</p></div>"
      },
      {
        "line": 45,
        "text": "<aside class=\"lesson-box\" aria-label=\"Original lesson downloads\"><h2>Take the reasoning into a lesson</h2><p>Twelve original questions connect operations, prefix states, ties and representation. Download the course and open it through RecallWeave's existing local lesson preview.</p><button type=\"button\" id=\"edit-download-lesson\">Download lesson</button><button type=\"button\" id=\"edit-download-guide\">Download worked guide</button></aside>"
      },
